rn your passion into purpose. At the University of Maine System, there’s something for everyone. Whether you’re helping students discover who they are, contributing to groundbreaking research, or driving technological innovation, you’ll have the opportunity across all of Maine’s Public Universities to be part of what makes Maine great. Explore open positions A workplace that works for you. Generous paid time off From vacation days to sick days and everything in between, we make sure you have time to take care of what matters most. Medical coverage From vacation days to sick days and everything in between, we make sure you have time to take care of what matters most. Tuition waiver We offer a tuition waiver, plus tuition support for your family—so you and your loved ones can keep learning. Emerging technology Be a part of a university system that invests in growth opportunities and technological advancements in engineering, the arts, and AI. Professional development We want to see you grow and thrive. You can upskill and advance in your career through targeted skills training, institutional support, and tuition waivers. At the University of Maine System, we don’t just work together—we grow together. Our universities and people reflect the best of Maine: resilient, curious, and committed to making a difference.” –  Amie Parker, Chief Human Resources Officer There’s a reason 40% of our employees are former students. Because when you work for the University of Maine System, you’re joining a community of universities and colleagues who care about the mission—and each other—as much as you do. Join our community The University of Maine The University of Maine at Augusta University of Maine at Farmington University of Maine at Fort Kent The University of Maine at Machias The University of Maine at Presque Isle University of Southern Maine University of Maine School of Law The University of Maine The University of Maine at Augusta The University of Maine at Farmington The Un